8. Prompt layout reorder + standardize delimiters + new file-action output format
    purpose: better K/V cache hit rate, unambiguous section boundaries, model output symmetry with input, action validation

    [x] 'content/a_lib/shared-assets/layouts/prompt.layout': Reorder slots — base_fragments, repo_content, domain_fragments, prompt_fragments
        - repo_content before domain/prompt because it changes on commit (rare), domain/prompt changes on backlog edit (frequent)
        - instructions at tail = closer to generation, better compliance
